What is the purpose?

Whenever you change your application code and push it to GitHub:

* GitHub detects the new commit.

* GitHub Actions starts automatically.

* Docker builds a new image.

* The image gets uploaded to Docker Hub.

* The image also gets uploaded to GitHub Container Registry.

This is our automated build and distribution pipeline.

